          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I'm still confused about the frame format for FlexRay (I don't have any logs on hand). From the AUTOSAR specification, it looks like after the addresses there's only one byte before the data in Consecutive Frames, but in ISO 10681-2 I see that there should be another byte called FPL (Frame Payload Length).",
